==Notes==
This quest is only available during the time of [[Spring Eggstravaganza]].
==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:The Eggcitingly Eggcellent Egg Hunt]] in order to do [[Quest:The Eggxtremely Eggcitingly Eggcellent Egg Hunt]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
==Goals==
One of Alyssa's eggs has been hidden somewhere in Sacred Grove and she needs you to find it.
*Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
*Return to Alyssa Eggelyn.
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"The Spring Eggstravaganza is here, but that darn robgoblin stole another one of my eggs. I can't possibly open my other eggs without that one. Do you think you could try to find it?" -Alyssa Eggelyn
#Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
#*The egg could be found behind a large pile of colorful gems in the [[Singing Crystal Mines]] of [[Snowhill]].
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"Eggcellent work, <Player Name>, and thank you for your help again. Now I can enjoy the Spring Eggstravaganza with a smile on my face, and you can take this special egg that I saved just for you." -Alyssa Eggelyn
